  "version": "HL7 v2.7",
  "chapter": "Observation Reporting",
  "description": "The OSM^R26 Unsolicited Specimen Shipment Manifest message is used to communicate the contents of a specimen shipment to a specimen receiver (typically a laboratory). The message documents details regard the following:\n- Shipment information including sender, receiver, shipper, shipping container, etc.;\n- Specimens in the shipment;\n- Specimen containers; and,\n- Identification of persons/places/things associated with the specimens.",
